From 72bb779e95da940c6dee1e4c983f5921de34a0e8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 00:22:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(kanban): retire released sender custody during copy
 deletion [daveey]

Repair two reproduced review blockers: worker-copy eviction now obtains verified history-delete custody, and deletion retires only matching observed stop requests before their history disappears. Unknown requests and foreign board/gateway/task/event coordinates remain protected. Rollback restores all deletion state.

Proof: original reviewer paths reproduced 2 failures with 3 controls. Canonical four-file controls pass; isolated real workerd/core transport 33 checks pass. Twelve exact retirement/eviction removal mutants killed with a green baseline. Added independent adjacent SQL permit tests. Complete guard inventory and final CI/review/deployment remain separate delivery gates.
